---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Brands from "../components/Brands.astro";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactForm.astro";
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Lodges & Lodging - Massive Trout Fly Fishing, Patagonia Argentina" description="Fly Fishing in Patagonia Argentina" bodyClass="no-js">
  <section class="sec__hero hero--small" id="hero_lodges">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main role="main">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="project-slider-container">
        <ul class="js-project-slider project-slider" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-timing="2500" data-dots="true" data-controls="true">
          <li class="js-project-slide project-slide">
            <img src="/images/lodges/carrusel_lodges_01.jpg" alt="Lodges in Patagonia" loading="lazy" />
          </li>
          <li class="js-project-slide project-slide">
            <img src="/images/lodges/carrusel_lodges_02.jpg" alt="Lodges in Patagonia" loading="lazy" />
          </li>
          <li class="js-project-slide project-slide">
            <img src="/images/lodges/carrusel_lodges_03.jpg" alt="Lodges in Patagonia" loading="lazy" />
          </li>
          <li class="js-project-slide project-slide">
            <img src="/images/lodges/carrusel_lodges_04.jpg" alt="Lodges in Patagonia" loading="lazy" />
          </li>
        </ul>
        <nav class="js-project-slides-navigation project-slides-navigation slides-navigation">
          <a href="#" class="js-slide-next next" aria-label="Next slide"></a>
          <a href="#" class="js-slide-prev prev" aria-label="Previous slide"></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="sec__intro intro_sinback intro_lodges">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <h2 class="heading--intro text--center">The Fishing Trip Experience of a Lifetime</h2>
          <h3 class="heading--small text--center">22 YEARS GUIDING FISHERMEN FROM ALL OVER THE WORLD</h3>
          <img class="separador" src="/images/shared/separators/separador.png" alt="separador" />
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Many times, our clients and guests prefer to fish in the wildest and most remote places of Patagonia, where it is possible to spend an entire day without encountering another fisherman or boat, while still returning each evening to the comfort and exceptional service of the best lodges.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            With more than 22 years of experience, Massive Trout has established strong relationships throughout Northern Patagonia, working season after season with some of the finest lodges and fishing destinations in the region. These long-standing partnerships allow us not only to access some of the best fishing waters, but also to provide our clients with the comfort, personalized attention, and service they deserve.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Today, our experience and network extend beyond Patagonia. Through our activity in the United States with Cowboys Drifters, we have expanded our services to include premium lodging experiences as well as exceptional Golden Dorado fishing programs. This new chapter allows us to connect some of the world's most exciting fishing destinations with the same philosophy that has defined Massive Trout for more than two decades: outstanding fishing, carefully selected accommodations, local expertise, and personalized service.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            It is also common for clients from different parts of the world to choose Massive Trout for an all-inclusive experience. Depending on their preferences and requirements, we organize everything from lodging in the finest cabins, apartments, hotels, and fishing lodges to fine breakfasts, lunches and dinners, excellent wines, transportation, guides, and everything else a fisherman may need to enjoy the trip of a lifetime.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Whether fishing the wild rivers and lakes of Patagonia or pursuing Golden Dorado in South America, our goal remains the same: to create unforgettable fishing experiences, combining exceptional waters, outstanding lodging, and the highest level of personal attention.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            <strong>You tell us what you want to experience. We organize the rest.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec__lodges">
    <div class="container padding-top2x">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-5 text--center">
          <img class="team__avatar img-responsive img_river" src="/images/lodges/lodge_01.png" alt="Lodges" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-7">
          <div class="river__content">
            <h2 id="river__name">🇦🇷 Patagonia</h2>
            <h3 id="river__subt">Nahuel Huapi National Park - Rio Negro Province</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Arroyo Verde Lodge</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Rio Manso Lodge (Orvis endorser)</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> AirB&B</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 id="river__subt">Lanin National Park - Neuquen Province</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Tipiliuke Lodge</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Quemquemtreu Lodge</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> San Huberto Lodge</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Collon Cura Lodge</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Estancia Quillén</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Hostería Rahue (Aluminé)</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 id="river__subt">Los Alerces National Park - Chubut Province</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> El Encuentro Lodge</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="clearfix"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container padding-top2x">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-5 text--center">
          <img class="team__avatar img-responsive img_river" src="/images/lodges/lodges-dorado-circle.png" alt="Dorado lodges" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-7">
          <div class="river__content">
            <h2 id="river__name">🇦🇷 Corrientes</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Pinti's Lodge</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="clearfix"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container padding-top2x">
      <div class="row padding-bottom2x">
        <div class="col-md-5 text--center">
          <img class="team__avatar img-responsive img_river" src="/images/lodges/lodge-wyoming-circle.png" alt="Wyoming lodges" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-7">
          <div class="river__content">
            <h2 id="river__name">🇺🇸 Wyoming, Casper</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Grey Reef Cabins</li>
              <li><p class="fa fa-circle"></p> Cowboys Drifters Cabins</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="clearfix"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Brands
    className="lodges-brands"
    heading="We are supported by the following brands"
    subheading="Fish with the best"
  />

  <section class="sec__contact">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="heading--big text--center">Contact Us</h2>
      <h3 class="text--grey text--center">FOR A SALUTATION OR FOR INFORMATION!</h3>
      <img class="separador" src="/images/shared/separators/separador.png" alt="separador" />
      <ContactForm lang="en" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
